# Project-local
# Daily review outputs (post.md, final_post.json, grounding.md, skip.json, etc.)
# are committed by the daily GitHub Action so the human-review trail lives in
# the repo. PDFs stay local — they're regenerable and dominate repo size.
reviews/**/paper.pdf

